WEBVTT

00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:35.310
And so...

00:01:35.830 --> 00:01:36.950
well...

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:42.390
...were you at my place all night
that night?

00:01:42.890 --> 00:01:43.610
Yes.

00:01:44.530 --> 00:01:47.510
I-I suppose I did something
impolite to you?

00:01:49.060 --> 00:01:53.500
Please don't worry about it.
I know it meant nothing.

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:56.360
-- Umm..
-- Yes?!

00:01:57.370 --> 00:02:00.230
Do you not
remember anything?

00:02:01.510 --> 00:02:04.310
N-Not everything.

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:06.640
I...

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:12.140
I won't forget,
because I'm a woman.

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:16.520
But don't worry.

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:20.080
I won't push you into marriage.

00:02:24.460 --> 00:02:26.860
It means enough to me

00:02:26.930 --> 00:02:28.420
that you came all
the way here to see me.

00:02:52.570 --> 00:02:56.360
I'm home. I see you're
all doing well

00:02:56.430 --> 00:02:58.860
I'm sorry I left you
for so long.

00:03:00.830 --> 00:03:02.550
Welcome home, Miss.

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:05.140
I don't see Salad.

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:08.010
She hasn't been herself
in the last few days,

00:03:08.270 --> 00:03:10.540
so we're having the
veterinarian examine her.

00:03:10.640 --> 00:03:12.880
I wonder what's wrong?

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:14.110
Asuna?

00:03:14.660 --> 00:03:17.950
Mother, I'm home.

00:03:18.260 --> 00:03:22.240
I must speak to you at once.
Come to me after you change.

00:03:22.860 --> 00:03:23.630
Yes.

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:29.160
Mitaka phoned?

00:03:30.110 --> 00:03:35.130
He mentioned that he wanted to
speak to you after you got back.

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:42.480
I'm overjoyed by the fact

00:03:42.550 --> 00:03:45.640
that he came all the way
to Izu to see me.

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:51.050
What happened between
you and Mitaka?

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:53.420
When your father and I

00:03:53.490 --> 00:03:55.730
were away to our relatives'
for the memorial service.

00:03:58.200 --> 00:04:02.100
I heard you stayed
over at Mitaka's condo.

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:07.360
I'm sorry, Miss!

00:04:07.770 --> 00:04:09.490
I've come to the realization

00:04:09.670 --> 00:04:13.670
that this was too significant
to keep to myself.

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:15.840
So you told her
about that night?

00:04:16.420 --> 00:04:17.000
Yes.

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:25.250
Kimida, please help!

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:27.220
What's the matter?

00:04:36.270 --> 00:04:37.790
He's so deeply asleep,

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:41.320
I can't move him to
his bed by myself.

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:43.860
He's quite drunk.

00:04:44.370 --> 00:04:46.420
Get up.

00:04:46.520 --> 00:04:47.800
Will you be all right?

00:04:48.310 --> 00:04:49.650
I think I can manage.

00:04:50.240 --> 00:04:53.070
Please help him change
into something comfortable.

00:04:53.160 --> 00:04:54.280
Yes, Miss.

00:05:04.560 --> 00:05:05.610
Thank you.

00:05:05.690 --> 00:05:06.590
No problem.

00:05:07.270 --> 00:05:09.620
It's quite late, Miss.

00:05:09.970 --> 00:05:11.400
Please wait in the car.

00:05:20.440 --> 00:05:23.170
Please...do as I say.

00:05:24.850 --> 00:05:30.000
At the time, I knew they
were practically engaged,

00:05:30.460 --> 00:05:32.650
so I excused myself.

00:05:33.730 --> 00:05:37.480
But the engagement ceremony
was postponed soon thereafter!

00:05:38.970 --> 00:05:42.250
I should have forced
Miss Asuna to leave that night!

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:44.860
Don't worry about it.

00:05:45.480 --> 00:05:48.710
It was poor judgment
on my part!

00:05:49.650 --> 00:05:51.570
It's my fault that
Miss Asuna has been damaged!

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:53.800
Kimida.

00:05:53.870 --> 00:05:56.430
How dare you
call her damaged!

00:05:56.720 --> 00:05:57.770
I'm sorry!

00:05:58.520 --> 00:06:01.130
This was all due
to my incompetence!

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:02.500
Please don't blame yourself.

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:04.520
By the time I called
for your help,

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:06.170
Mitaka and I had already.

00:06:10.490 --> 00:06:14.730
Y-You mean, that night,
you and Mitaka actually.

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:19.360
Go ahead and laugh
at your loose daughter.

00:06:20.130 --> 00:06:22.800
This is no laughing matter!

00:06:23.300 --> 00:06:25.470
We must call your
doctor at once!

00:06:25.550 --> 00:06:26.560
Kimida, call the doctor now.

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:27.110
Yes, Ma'am.

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:30.000
Why are you
calling the doctor?

00:06:30.520 --> 00:06:34.420
You need to be examined,
Just in case.

00:06:34.720 --> 00:06:35.730
Just in case what?

00:06:35.820 --> 00:06:37.220
In case you have a baby.

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:38.000
I had never heard

00:06:38.090 --> 00:06:42.350
that a baby can be
conceived with just a kiss!

00:06:43.030 --> 00:06:45.680
Neither have I, but-

00:06:49.360 --> 00:06:52.300
You mean you and Mitaka
only kissed that night?

00:06:52.630 --> 00:06:53.250
Yes.

00:06:53.410 --> 00:06:55.690
Then what happened after
I left the room?

00:06:56.410 --> 00:06:59.630
I tidied up and
prepared his breakfast.

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:03.130
Is that really
all that happened, Asuna?!

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:07.000
Yes. Mitaka was
sleeping very soundly.

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:22.160
Shall I phone him?

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:26.550
What did Mitaka want
to speak to me about?

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:31.360
Miss!

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:37.110
Doctor! I hear
Salad is not well

00:07:37.590 --> 00:07:39.570
Actually, she's expecting.

00:07:39.720 --> 00:07:41.270
She is?

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:43.480
I'm sure of it.

00:07:46.030 --> 00:07:47.290
I wonder who the father is?

00:07:58.170 --> 00:08:03.800
You're so lucky.
Not a care in the world.

00:08:14.660 --> 00:08:16.480
Grandma?

00:08:16.590 --> 00:08:19.240
Yeah. She's going home
to the country tomorrow.

00:08:19.690 --> 00:08:21.460
So suddenly?

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:24.420
It's probably Godai's fault.

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:29.790
He's left her here and hasn't
come back in more than a week.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.530
But that's because
he's devoting himself

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:33.090
to study for his final exams.

00:08:33.670 --> 00:08:37.870
He has another reason
he can't come home, doesn't he?

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:42.190
Maybe he's still hurt that
someone kicked him out of here.

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:47.380
Godai left on his own will

00:08:47.850 --> 00:08:51.120
Did he?
It's because you hit him.

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:57.160
Anyway, let's give Grandma
a send-off party tonight!

00:08:57.220 --> 00:08:59.840
We'll make it real lively!

00:09:00.190 --> 00:09:01.750
Let's call Godai!

00:09:01.830 --> 00:09:03.050
Good idea!

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:04.590
It's decided, then!

00:09:20.810 --> 00:09:22.330
Gotta hit the books.

00:09:28.130 --> 00:09:31.390
We'll miss you, Grandma.

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:32.300
I'll say!

00:09:32.690 --> 00:09:35.310
You'll be glad
to see me gone.

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:37.680
We wouldn't think that!

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:41.660
Before I leave, maybe I'll
play against Coach Mitaka.

00:09:41.740 --> 00:09:44.090
I wouldn't, if I were you.

00:09:44.650 --> 00:09:46.600
Why not?

00:09:47.070 --> 00:09:50.690
Coach Mitaka hasn't
been himself lately.

00:09:51.990 --> 00:09:55.150
I bet it's because Kyoko
hasn't been coming lately.

00:09:57.350 --> 00:09:58.840
I'm sorry, Coach!

00:09:59.300 --> 00:10:01.050
But something's not right.

00:10:02.800 --> 00:10:07.130
It would be easier if
they forced me to marry her.

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:10.130
I can't take
this awkwardness anymore.

00:10:10.510 --> 00:10:11.220
Mitaka?

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:14.720
Now I'm hearing voices.

00:10:15.410 --> 00:10:16.300
Mitaka?

00:10:18.150 --> 00:10:19.430
MITAKA!

00:10:19.520 --> 00:10:20.240
What?!

00:10:21.780 --> 00:10:22.760
What is it?

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:26.500
Asuna!

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:30.930
Coach Mitaka! There's
a baby on the way!

00:10:34.090 --> 00:10:37.120
A baby?! You can't mean--!

00:10:39.770 --> 00:10:41.390
It's from that night.

00:10:42.510 --> 00:10:44.670
No! It's got
to be a mistake.

00:10:45.270 --> 00:10:48.630
The doctor told me
that he is sure of it.

00:10:53.570 --> 00:10:54.430
No way...

00:10:54.520 --> 00:10:56.800
Do you know what
she's talking about?

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:06.510
Let's go over there to talk.

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:07.930
Yes.

00:11:11.270 --> 00:11:15.030
I knew this would
happen one day.

00:11:15.270 --> 00:11:17.450
Coach Mitaka gets around.

00:11:17.640 --> 00:11:21.930
This is making me
want to stick around.

00:11:28.470 --> 00:11:30.460
Uh... I don't know what to say.

00:11:30.680 --> 00:11:32.440
I'm a bit shocked.

00:11:32.810 --> 00:11:33.650
I'm sorry.

00:11:33.990 --> 00:11:36.710
I wanted to let you know
as soon as possible.

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:43.760
Please give me
some time to think.

00:11:44.030 --> 00:11:45.050
Please don't.

00:11:49.960 --> 00:11:53.130
I won't burden you

00:11:53.380 --> 00:11:54.640
What do you mean?

00:11:55.570 --> 00:11:58.300
I can raise the
babies by myself.

00:11:59.470 --> 00:12:02.830
I'm sure I'll be able
to raise them respectably.

00:12:03.210 --> 00:12:04.740
What are you saying?!

00:12:04.810 --> 00:12:07.910
Do you think I'm
that irresponsible?!

00:12:09.320 --> 00:12:11.990
Now that what's done is done,
I won't run or hide.

00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:13.920
I will take
full responsibility.

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:16.920
I will pay a visit
to your parents tonight.

00:12:17.220 --> 00:12:19.130
Let's do this properly.

00:12:19.770 --> 00:12:20.550
Y-Yes?!

00:12:55.930 --> 00:12:57.870
Time to go shopping,
Soichiro.

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:02.770
Hey! Hey!

00:13:04.480 --> 00:13:06.520
What's the matter,
Mrs. Ichinose?

00:13:07.120 --> 00:13:12.270
Coach Mitaka's done it!
That's what!

00:13:14.120 --> 00:13:16.110
What? A baby?!

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:21.810
Are you surprised?

00:13:22.130 --> 00:13:23.410
Well, yes.

00:13:24.560 --> 00:13:26.760
So what are you going to do?

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:29.220
Why would I do anything?

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:35.420
Boy, it's cold!

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:46.740
H-Hello.

00:14:12.170 --> 00:14:14.840
You must think
I'm irresponsible.

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:16.900
No.

00:14:18.410 --> 00:14:21.250
I have no right
to be seeing you,

00:14:23.230 --> 00:14:26.020
but if I don't say good-bye,
I'd regret it.

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:37.130
I don't know how
to say it best...

00:14:38.200 --> 00:14:41.640
...but I want you to be happy.

00:14:43.750 --> 00:14:46.980
Do you think
you'll be happy?

00:14:50.720 --> 00:14:53.150
I hope so.
I better work on it!

00:15:00.550 --> 00:15:02.150
I had...

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:05.790
...a lot of other things
I wanted to talk to you about, but.

00:15:32.150 --> 00:15:33.140
Good-bye.

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:35.510
I wish you happiness.

00:15:49.250 --> 00:15:50.970
G-Grandma! Are you sure?!

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:53.480
From the looks of it,
it's definite.

00:15:55.040 --> 00:15:57.800
I see.. Mitaka.

00:15:58.090 --> 00:16:00.540
I'm going home tomorrow,

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:04.850
so stop being a hard-head and
go back to your apartment.

00:16:05.100 --> 00:16:06.860
I-I wasn't...

00:16:07.150 --> 00:16:08.990
Let's play!

00:16:09.920 --> 00:16:10.940
All right, all right.

00:16:11.600 --> 00:16:15.090
I hope I get to see
my great-grandchildren soon.

00:16:17.340 --> 00:16:20.060
I hope they look
cute like the manager.

00:16:20.140 --> 00:16:21.650
G-Grandma!

00:16:23.010 --> 00:16:25.020
Oops! Sorry!

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:30.470
I suppose if what Grandma
is saying is true,

00:16:30.720 --> 00:16:33.380
then my rival is gone.

00:16:42.190 --> 00:16:42.850
Hello?

00:16:44.970 --> 00:16:46.790
I heard you went
to see the Kujos

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:49.770
to Formally ask for
her hand in marriage.

00:16:50.060 --> 00:16:52.230
Yes. I just
came back from there.

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:56.290
What brought you around,
after so much resistance?

00:16:56.770 --> 00:17:00.510
I have my reasons.
You'll see soon.

00:17:01.480 --> 00:17:03.970
Yes, yes. Bye.

00:17:08.860 --> 00:17:12.710
To protect your coming baby,
invest in life insurance.

00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:14.790
Please, Papa!

00:17:16.370 --> 00:17:17.350
Papa...

00:17:24.260 --> 00:17:25.860
I really don't get it.

00:17:27.200 --> 00:17:29.400
Please let me marry Asuna!

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:32.930
Asuna?!

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:34.840
What's wrong, Asuna?

00:17:37.390 --> 00:17:39.710
I'm so happy.
So lucky.

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:48.410
Anyway.. I better
make her happy.

00:17:57.370 --> 00:18:00.390
Let's party hearty
again tonight!

00:18:00.780 --> 00:18:03.570
You don't seem to be
getting into the spirit.

00:18:04.150 --> 00:18:06.900
You're going to put everything
on my tab, aren't you?

00:18:06.970 --> 00:18:10.570
Of course. It's a farewell
party for your Grandma.

00:18:11.410 --> 00:18:14.470
We thought you'd feel
uncomfortable at Maison,

00:18:14.560 --> 00:18:17.210
so we took the trouble
to come here.

00:18:17.480 --> 00:18:18.700
How nice of you.

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:21.290
By the way, where's Grandma?

00:18:21.400 --> 00:18:23.120
She left to go to the restroom.

00:18:23.190 --> 00:18:26.560
I hope she's not passed out
from drinking too much.

00:18:26.760 --> 00:18:28.630
No, she's a toughie.

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:34.760
G-Grandma?!

00:18:35.350 --> 00:18:36.570
You called?

00:18:37.850 --> 00:18:39.900
Are you insane?

00:18:40.350 --> 00:18:42.280
She insisted on trying it on
and having some fun

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:43.840
before she hits the grave.

00:18:44.150 --> 00:18:46.660
Last Night Fever in Tokyo!

00:18:46.750 --> 00:18:47.730
Let's go!

00:19:04.900 --> 00:19:05.920
Welcome back.

00:19:07.230 --> 00:19:08.690
Thank you.

00:19:09.280 --> 00:19:11.170
What happened to Grandma?

00:19:11.650 --> 00:19:13.660
She had too much to drink.

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:16.660
I see. Bye.

00:19:17.650 --> 00:19:18.190
Good night.

00:19:19.290 --> 00:19:20.340
-- Umm...
-- Yes?

00:19:21.450 --> 00:19:23.470
Are you not done
with finals yet?

00:19:23.790 --> 00:19:25.550
I have two more exams left.

00:19:26.490 --> 00:19:27.330
I see.

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:31.390
Good luck.

00:19:33.190 --> 00:19:33.670
Thanks!

00:19:46.280 --> 00:19:51.400
It's so boring...
now that Grandma is gone.

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:54.310
This year is almost over.

00:19:57.650 --> 00:20:01.480
I think today is Coach Mitaka's
engagement ceremony.

00:20:48.230 --> 00:20:50.290
Everything went so well

00:20:50.380 --> 00:20:52.200
Yes! Thank you for everything.

00:20:52.280 --> 00:20:53.250
Not a problem.

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:58.280
Shun sure settled down suddenly.
Something must have happened.

00:20:58.450 --> 00:21:00.120
It's his age!

00:21:03.060 --> 00:21:03.940
Are you tired?

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:05.650
No.

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:08.320
-- Umm...
-- Yes?

00:21:09.260 --> 00:21:13.160
I started thinking
about the babies' names.

00:21:13.400 --> 00:21:14.330
Yes?

00:21:14.600 --> 00:21:17.530
I wanted to try to incorporate
the father's name.

00:21:19.810 --> 00:21:21.100
What is it?

00:21:21.310 --> 00:21:24.300
Huh?! It's Shun! Please!

00:21:24.940 --> 00:21:28.110
Shun.  How very Japanese.

00:21:28.820 --> 00:21:30.500
I have to rethink this.

00:21:31.090 --> 00:21:35.240
I was thinking Crouton,
Pate, or Pickles,

00:21:35.530 --> 00:21:39.180
in line with
the mother's name.

00:21:40.720 --> 00:21:43.710
What name are you
talking about?

00:21:44.070 --> 00:21:48.150
You know, Salad and
your doggie's babies.

00:21:50.110 --> 00:21:51.870
D-Dogs?!

00:21:53.200 --> 00:21:55.760
I can't wait to see the babies!

00:21:57.850 --> 00:22:01.280
I'm sure they'll be cute
like their Papa and Mama!

00:22:25.110 --> 00:22:27.400
M-McEnroe!

00:22:28.610 --> 00:22:30.650
You!

00:22:32.050 --> 00:22:34.780
Because of you, my life is.

00:22:36.410 --> 00:22:39.080
This is all your fault!!

00:22:51.570 --> 00:22:52.750
Have you heard?

00:22:53.300 --> 00:22:55.890
It was her DOG
that was pregnant.

00:22:55.960 --> 00:22:58.690
I'm not surprised.
It's Coach Mitaka's dog.

00:22:58.970 --> 00:23:03.310
Now that he's formally engaged,
there's no turning back.

00:23:11.010 --> 00:23:12.070
I'm sorry.

00:23:15.790 --> 00:23:17.970
Err...Mitaka.

00:23:21.900 --> 00:23:22.620
I...

00:23:23.160 --> 00:23:24.630
I don't know how
to say it best.

00:23:29.810 --> 00:23:30.790
But...

00:23:33.080 --> 00:23:34.230
I wish you happiness.

00:23:36.970 --> 00:23:37.530
Thanks.

00:23:49.890 --> 00:23:51.450
What? Godai?

00:23:51.530 --> 00:23:53.050
...And Kozue kissed?!

00:23:53.120 --> 00:23:56.250
And Manager saw the whole thing!

00:23:56.320 --> 00:23:57.840
What's that idiot doing?

00:23:59.130 --> 00:24:03.000
Next: "Love All Over.
The Lingering Taste of Kozue's Kisses"

00:24:03.740 --> 00:24:05.230
I wish it were me!
